Task 4: Draft the Transfer Impact Assessment (TIA)
Produce assessment/TIA_report.md synthesizing Tasks 1-3. Required sections:

Executive Summary
Transfer Description (reference diagram)
Legal Basis & Mechanism Selected
Law Enforcement/Government Access Risk Analysis (UAE surveillance laws vs. EDPB baseline)
Supplementary Measures Applied
Residual Risk Rating (overall)
Recommendation (proceed / proceed with conditions / do not transfer)
This is a written analytical deliverable — no code scaffold provided. Apply the EDPB six-step TIA methodology explicitly and cite which step produced each conclusion.

Task 5: Technical Mitigation Recommendation
Based on residual risk from Task 4, design one mitigation and justify the trade-off:

Option A — Data Localization: Keep HR special-category fields in a UAE-region data store; transfer only pseudonymized/aggregated payroll totals to Frankfurt
Option B — Encryption-in-Transit + Client-Side Encryption: Implement field-level encryption before transfer, with keys held exclusively by the UAE entity
Deliverable: assessment/mitigation_recommendation.md — one page comparing latency, compliance cost, and residual risk reduction for both options, with a final recommendation.

