Conclusion
In this lab, you constructed an end-to-end cross-border transfer assessment spanning UAE, EU, and KSA jurisdictions. You modeled a realistic HR data flow, coded adequacy and PDPL decision logic, completed SCC Module 2 documentation with EDPB-aligned supplementary measures, authored a full Transfer Impact Assessment using the six-step methodology, and evaluated localization versus encryption-based mitigations against compliance and performance trade-offs. These skills map directly to the Privacy Counsel and Compliance Manager roles and reinforce CIPP/E competencies in international data transfer mechanisms.
